{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:02V4:statement", "parent_tag": "01V4", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "Let\n<MATH_0001>\nbe a cartesian diagram of schemes. Let <MATH_0002>, resp.<SPACE_0001><MATH_0003>\nbe the open subscheme of points where <MATH_0004>, resp.<SPACE_0002><MATH_0005> is smooth.\nThen <MATH_0006> if\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0007> is flat and locally of finite presentation, or\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0008> is locally of finite presentation and <MATH_0009> is flat.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nX' \\ar[r]_{g'} \\ar[d]_{f'} & X \\ar[d]^f \\\\\nS' \\ar[r]^g & S\n}\n$$", "MATH_0002": "$W \\subset X$", "SPACE_0001": "\\ ", "MATH_0003": "$W' \\subset X'$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "SPACE_0002": "\\ ", "MATH_0005": "$f'$", "MATH_0006": "$W' = (g')^{-1}(W)$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "MATH_0007": "$f$", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "MATH_0008": "$f$", "MATH_0009": "$g$", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-set-points-where-fibres-smooth}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:e18c079954e29ea12680fd13bc88e3183bb89ca30f81f294b367aed514d77c73", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ec5a4dfbaf1d81cd9b8348be2e09ab69180be7deb07c610a6e693e14b3d9aa06", "source_math_hash": "sha256:03fcda36f22e0f69d74bf112f4e9369e3e109133a7e914c77ba4fd54cc0c151d"}
